An AI Agent is software that can:

Observe its environment
Understand a user's request
Decide what action to take
Execute that action
Return the result

It works toward a specific objective.

AI Agent Workflow
User
   │
   ▼
Receive Request
   │
   ▼
Reason
   │
   ▼
Take Action
   │
   ▼
Return Result

=====

Example

User:

Show buses from Chennai to Madurai under ₹1000.

The AI Agent:

Understands the request
Searches the bus database
Filters fare < ₹1000
Returns matching buses

This is exactly how your Tamil Nadu Private Omni Bus AI Chatbot works.

